I am confused now. According the ASN definition, MIB is under BCCH-BCH. This is the one decoded and this the one I count in the stat. What do I misinterpret here?

```
-- ASN1START
-- TAG-BCCH-BCH-MESSAGE-START

BCCH-BCH-Message ::=            SEQUENCE {
    message                         BCCH-BCH-MessageType
}

BCCH-BCH-MessageType ::=        CHOICE {
    mib                             MIB,
    messageClassExtension           SEQUENCE {}
}

-- TAG-BCCH-BCH-MESSAGE-STOP
-- ASN1STOP
```

Any recommendation how to do it? 

I mean for now I could statically use the number of items in the value string which I am sure it's not acceptable.

```c
const value_string nr_rrc_scch_strings[] =
